B.ax3=new A.cY("universal_gravity","Gravity","On Success, Before or after any other effects, either dash one of the targets to a free space within {Half Source} of them, or dash you and allies within 1 to a free space within {Half Source}.")
B.awU=new A.cY("universal_hate","Hate","On Success, you may deal yourself up to {Source d12} damage to increase the damage to the targets by the same amount.")
B.awN=new A.cY("universal_inspiring","Inspiring","After you Succeed with the attack, 1 ally within 6 spaces gains {Source d6} Shield.")
B.awZ=new A.cY("universal_illness","Illness","On Success, give one of the targets {Half Source} d6 bleed, While they have this bleed, their speed is reduced by {Half Source}. You may give yourself this bleed, if you do also give it to enemies range 1 of you.")
B.ax5=new A.cY("universal_jamming","Jamming","After you Success with the attack, and if the target was concentrating, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage. The target has disadvantage on their concentration check for this attack. If the target begins concentrating before the start of your next turn, they must immediately make a concentration check as if they had taken damage.")
B.awY=new A.cY("universal_life","Life","On Success, Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Source d6}.")
B.ax7=new A.cY("universal_lightning","Lightning","On Success, Knock the targets prone and Deal {Half Source d6} damage to all prone enemies within 3 of the targets excluding the targets. If the targets were prone before the attack, damage them as well.")
B.ax2=new A.cY("universal_power_attack","Power Attack","You may gain disadvantage on the attack and deal {Source d6} extra damage on success. If you do, you must roll with disadvantage even if you have advantage.")
B.ax9=new A.cY("universal_pull","Pull","After you Success with an attack, the attack pulls enemies toward you {2*Source} for melee attacks and {Source} for ranged attacks.")
B.awV=new A.cY("universal_push","Push","After you Succeed with an attack, You may push an enemy up to {2*Source} for melee attacks and {Source} for ranged attacks.")
B.ax4=new A.cY("universal_rainbow","Rainbow","When you make the attack, you may choose to target any defense.")
B.awR=new A.cY("universal_reaching","Reaching","Increase the range of the ability attack by {Half Source}.")
