B.Z0=new A.an("feature_constrict","Constrict","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy range 1. On success, deal {Source d10} damage to the target and they become constricted. While constricted, you and the target are restrained and stunned. At the start of the target's or your turn, make a status check vs Str. On success, deal {Half Source d10} damage, on Failure the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When an enemy becomes range 1 during its turn, spend your reaction and make a constrict attack against the target.",B.L,B.abD,!1)
B.VL=new A.t("feature_consume_bite","Bite","You may target an adjacent enemy who isn\u2019t defeated with consume, when you do, make a Melee Attack vs Str, On Success: deal {Source d8} damage to the target and gain the consume healing and shield. You must succeed to have consumed the body but you may not consume the body again even when the target is defeated.")
