B.XZ=new A.an("feature_consume","Consume","[Action] You consume an adjacent Defeated Body, healing {Source d12} and gaining {Source d12} shield. A body may only be consumed once. The body must be defeated to be consumed.\n\n[Reaction] When a creature in range 3 of you dies, you may spend your [reaction] to dash to a free space adjacent to the body and consume the body.",B.ay,B.abI,!1)
