B.Zb=new A.an("feature_corrosion","Corrosion","[Action]: Make a Melee Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy Range 3. On Success, the target gains {Source} d6 Burn vs Int. While the target has this burn you and your allies ignore the target\u2019s damage resistance and shield.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack, or an ally fails an attack during their turn, spend your reaction and give the targets {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Int. While the target has this burn you and your allies ignore the target's damage resistance and shield.",B.L,B.a6r,!1)
B.SE=new A.t("feature_eye_of_the_storm_combo_breeze","Combo Breeze","While concentrating, [Reaction] After the target succeeds with a melee attack, you may spend your reaction to make the Eye of the Storm Status Check against the enemy with a +1 bonus to success.")
