B.YF=new A.an("feature_eye_of_the_storm","Eye of the Storm","[Action] Target 1 creature you can see. As long as you remain concentrating, the first time an enemy starts or becomes {Source} spaces of the target during their turn, make a Status Check vs Str. On Success, deal {Source} d6 damage and push them {Source} spaces away. While concentrating, if you activate the ability again, you add the target to your concentration.\n\n[Reaction] During an Ally\u2019s turn who is range 3. Spend your reaction and begin concentrating on Eye of the storm targeting that ally.",B.ay,B.a9P,!1)
