B.YD=new A.an("feature_fae_step","Fae Step","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Cha targeting each enemy range 1. On a Success, deal {Source d8} damage. Regardless, you may then teleport up to {Source} spaces to a free space.\n\n[Reaction] When an enemy becomes adjacent to you, spend your reaction and deal {Half Source d8} Damage vs Cha and Teleport up to {Source} Spaces to a free space.",B.L,B.ab2,!1)
B.X9=new A.t("feature_firestorm_inferno","Inferno","While Concentrating: During your turn, spend your [Reaction] Make an Status Check vs Dex. On Success, Deal {Source d6} damage to each enemy in the zone.")
