B.Z8=new A.an("feature_firestorm","Firestorm","[Action] Target a 2 space area Range 8, as long as you remain concentrating. Whenever a character starts their turn in the area or enters it for the first time during their turn, Make a Status Check vs Dex, On Success, ignite them dealing {Source d6} Damage and giving them {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Wis.\nWhile concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] to move the zone {Power} spaces, moving does trigger the Effect on characters it passes over but never more than once.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack, Spend your reaction and place your firestorm so that at least 1 space of one of the targets of the triggering attack are in the firestorm.",B.L,B.a9X,!1)
B.VW=new A.t("feature_flight_flighty","Flighty","While concentrating, [Reaction] When you are targeted by an attack, you may spend your reaction to dash {Source} spaces. If the enemy can no longer target you with the ability, it automatically fails and doesn\u2019t affect you.")
