B.YQ=new A.an("feature_fury","Fury","[Action] As long as you remain concentrating, when you activate this and the first time you fail an attack or defense each round, dash {Half Source} then make a Melee Attack vs Str. On success, deal {Source d12} damage. You still make the attack even if you fail the concentration check for fury.\n\n[Reaction] After failing a defense, you may spend your reaction, target an enemy range 1 and deal {Half Source d12} damage vs Str and begin concentrating on your fury if you aren\u2019t.",B.L,B.ab6,!1)
