B.Z6=new A.an("feature_ignite","Ignite","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Vit targeting an enemy range 3. On Success, they take {Source d6} damage and give the target {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. If the target already has burn, instead give its current burn to each enemy adjacent to them then increase its burn by {Half Source d6}.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack, spend your reaction. Pick one of the targets of the triggering attack and give the target {Half Source} d6 burn vs Dex.  If the target already has burn, instead give its current burn to each enemy adjacent to them then increase its burn by {Half Source d6}.",B.L,B.aaC,!1)
