B.Yi=new A.an("feature_illusions","Illusions","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int: On a Success, create up to {Source} spaces worth of illusions that last as long as you remain concentrating. Each space of illusions follows the wall rules from skills. You may create barriers instead of walls, creating 2 spaces of barrier for 1 space of wall. Your illusions are destroyed when hit by a single attack. You and your allies may move through your illusions causing them to be destroyed.\n\n[Reaction] At the Start of a turn, spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, create up to {Source} Spaces worth of illusions.\n\nWhile concentrating, if you activate the ability, you may add new illusions to the concentration. ",B.L,B.a8I,!1)
