B.Zd=new A.an("feature_jinx","Jinx","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Cha targeting each enemy range {1+Source}. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and as long as you remain concentrating, Jinx the targets. While Jinxed, you and all your allies have advantage on attacks against the targets.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an Ally succeeds on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and all the targets of the origin attack take {Half Source d6} and are jinxed as long as you are concentrating.\n\nWhile concentrating, if you activate the power again, you may add the targeted enemies to the group you are concentrating on.",B.L,B.a7O,!1)
B.Xh=new A.t("feature_justice_holy_fire","Holy Fire","Enemies damaged by justice also gain {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Cha.")
