B.SK=new A.t("feature_missile_barrage_Explosive","Explosive","You may force targets to dash 1 space per missile. You may target yourself or allies range 6, they resist the damage and are forced to dash {Half Source} spaces per missile instead.")
B.Vk=new A.t("feature_missile_barrage_Tracking","Tracking","On problems with the Action, You gain half of the missiles you would have had as tracking missiles that last until the end of your next turn. If you succeed on an attack or take the Missile reaction, you may distribute these tracking missiles to the targets to deal 1d6 damage. These missiles don\u2019t trigger the Big one.")
