B.Zq=new A.an("feature_mortar","Mortar","[Action] During your or an Ally\u2019s Turns, Spend your reaction and Target a free space range 1 and setup and fire your Mortar. Your mortar counts as a Barrier as if made by a skill, and you may spend supply to do anything but make multiple mortars as if it was a barrier. As long as it lasts, You and your allies can spend a [Reaction] to target a 1 space radius range {Source *3} of the mortar, they make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, and on success deal {Source d8} damage.\n\nCover: [Reaction] After an ally range {2*Source} of your Mortar fails on an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, On Success deal {Source d8} to enemies in a 1 space radius that contains at least 1 space containing a target of the triggering attack.",B.L,B.a70,!1)
B.TF=new A.t("feature_mushrooms_Skippers","Skippers","For Enemies, On success Reduce their speed by {Half Source}. For Allies, On Success, Give them {Half Source} additional speed until the start of your turn. You may move your Mushrooms up to {Half Source} Spaces during each of your turns.")
B.Tm=new A.t("feature_mushrooms_Stoners","Stoners","For Enemies, On Success: The enemy is stunned until the end of its turn but may not be stunned by stoners again this encounter. For Allies, On Success, The target has advantage on Int, Wis, and Cha defenses and disadvantage on concentration checks until the start of their next turn.")
B.Sb=new A.t("feature_mushrooms_Creepers","Creepers","while concentrating, [Action] make the status check targeting every creature range 1 of the area.")
B.a6F=s([B.TF,B.Tm,B.Sb],t.U)
B.YT=new A.an("feature_mushrooms","Mushrooms","[Action] Target a 1 space radius range 6 spaces, where mushrooms sprout from the ground. For as long as you remain concentrating, Whenever a creature starts their turn in the area or enters it for the first time on their turn, the mushrooms activate. For enemies, make a Status Check Vs Vit, On a Success, deal {Source d6} Damage. For Allies, make a Status Check, On Success, Heal {Source d6} HP.\n\nSpores [Reaction] During your or ally turns, Spend your reaction, and make a Status Check vs Vit. On Success, target all characters range 1 of the Triggering Character, Deal {Source d6} to Enemies and Heal {Source d6} to allies.",B.L,B.a6F,!1)
B.Wj=new A.t("feature_nightmare_Scream","Scream","When you fail the status check on a character with nightmares, make a status check vs cha targeting enemies within {Source} of the original target, excluding the original target. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage.")
B.Wp=new A.t("feature_nightmare_Monsters_Under_the_Bed","Monsters Under the Bed","When you succeed on the status check, deal 1d10 extra damage for each of your allies adjacent to the target.")
B.SW=new A.t("feature_nightmare_Crawling","Crawling","when you succeed on the status check, force the target to move {Half Source} ignoring the prone during the movement.")
B.a88=s([B.Wj,B.Wp,B.SW],t.U)
B.YX=new A.an("feature_nightmare","Nightmare","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range 4. On success, the target is knocked prone and is trapped in nightmares and is stunned. While having nightmares, on the start of the target's turn, make a status check vs int, on success the target is stunned and takes {Source d8} damage. On failure the effect ends. If the target is attacked by you or your allies, the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] Start of an enemy turn who is range 4 of you and has you or one of your allies adjacent to it. Make a Ranged Attack vs Int. On success, the target is knocked prone, is stunned and has nightmares.",B.L,B.a88,!1)
B.S0=new A.t("feature_ninja_Shuriken","Shuriken","Before Disappear or Withdraw, make an Ranged Attack targeting 1 enemy range 3/6 vs dex, On Success, Deal {Source d8} Damage.")
B.WX=new A.t("feature_ninja_Shadow_Blade","Shadow Blade","After you Disappear or Withdraw, your next Melee Attack deals an extra {Half Source d8} damage.")
B.TO=new A.t("feature_ninja_Return","Return","Before Disappearing or Withdrawing, target 1 enemy range 1. During your next turn, you may teleport to a free space adjacent to the targeted enemy one time.")
B.a9E=s([B.S0,B.WX,B.TO],t.U)
B.Zi=new A.an("feature_ninja","Ninja","Disappear: [Reaction] Start of any turn, Spend your reaction, Dash {Source} spaces to a free space then make a Conceal check to hide.\n\nWithdraw [Reaction] After you or an Ally makes an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction, Dash {Half Source} Spaces to a free space then make a Conceal check to Hide.\n",B.ay,B.a9E,!1)
B.WR=new A.t("feature_ooze_Acidic","Acidic","[Reaction] When damaged by an attack while concentrating on ooze, spend your reaction to Make an Status Check Vs Vit and target absorbed enemies and adjacent enemies. On a Success deal {Source d6} damage. If you fail to concentrate, this effect still occurs.")
B.TK=new A.t("feature_ooze_First_Hunter","First Hunter","You have advantage on concentration checks caused by targets, and +1 to defense results from attacks made by the targets.")
B.WT=new A.t("feature_ooze_Amoeba","Amoeba","While Concentrating, You cannot be flanked, and you suffer no speed penalty for squeezing. At the start of your turn, you and the targets all dash {Half Source} spaces to free spaces where you can all fit and the targets are still all range 1 of you.")
B.a9c=s([B.WR,B.TK,B.WT],t.U)
B.Zr=new A.an("feature_ooze","Ooze","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting enemies range 1. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to each target and absorb the targets as long as you remain concentrating. While absorbed you and the targets are restrained, and at the start of your turn, Deal {Half Source d6} damage to each target and heal {Half Source d6}. You have a +1 to concentration check results caused by the targets.\n\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends range 1 or after they miss you with a melee attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting the enemy. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and absorb the target as long as you remain concentrating.",B.L,B.a9c,!1)
B.TM=new A.t("feature_parry_Duelers_Dance","Dueler\u2019s Dance","On Success with your parry, You may move up to {Source} Spaces without provoking attacks. Then force the target into a free space adjacent to you.")
