B.a6q=s([B.VX,B.Xx,B.SZ],t.U)
B.Y4=new A.an("feature_pin","Pin","Pin [Action, 2 Unarmed] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1. On Success, deal {Source d6} and you grapple the target and have pinning as long as you remain grappling. While Pinning, enemies adjacent to you grant your allies advantage when making Attacks from outside the grapple against the target rather than disadvantage. If they roll 2 failures they attack you instead. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts its turn adjacent to you or becomes adjacent, Spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and grapple the target and gain pinning as long as you remain grappling.",B.L,B.a6q,!1)
B.Ta=new A.t("feature_poppet_Eyes","Eyes","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] until the start of your next turn, the target has disadvantage on ranged attacks and defense checks caused by attacks from non adjacent attackers.")
B.UM=new A.t("feature_poppet_Heart","Heart","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] deal {Half Source d6} damage ignoring shield and resistance. ")
B.VY=new A.t("feature_poppet_Junk","Junk","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] the target must make a concentration check with disadvantage if concentrating. Until the start of your next turn, reduce the target's speed by {Source} to no less than 1.")
B.a9u=s([B.Ta,B.UM,B.VY],t.U)
B.Zp=new A.an("feature_poppet","Poppet","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Cha targeting 1 enemy range 1. On Success, deal {Source d8} damage and you make a poppet of the target that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. While concentrating, you and your allies have a +1 to attack results against the target and +1 to defense results caused by the target. The poppet requires a hand to wield.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally succeeds with a melee attack during their turn and has a free hand, spend your reaction and create a poppet for 1 of the targets. If an ally is the triggering character, you still concentrate on the poppet even when they are holding it.",B.L,B.a9u,!1)
B.V4=new A.t("feature_puppet_Guilt","Guilt","When your puppet succeeds in attacking one of their allies, The puppet takes {Source d8} Damage.")
B.UB=new A.t("feature_puppet_BodyGuard","BodyGuard","[Reaction] When an attack would target you, you may spend your reaction to teleport your puppet to a free space adjacent to you and it becomes the target of the attack instead.")
B.TG=new A.t("feature_puppet_Distant_Strings","Distant Strings","The attack becomes Ranged with a range becomes {2*Source} /{4*Source}. If you Succeed on an attack at the long range, you have advantage on your first {Source} Status Checks vs the Target.")
B.aaz=s([B.V4,B.UB,B.TG],t.U)
B.YP=new A.an("feature_puppet","Puppet","[Action] Melee Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range {Source}, On Success: The target is your puppet as long as you remain concentrating. On the Start of Its Turn, Make an Status Check Vs Int, On Success: You may have the target move up to its speed and use a single Innate Action, [Chump Action], or Skill in combat action against a target of your choice. On a Miss: The target is stunned and the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally Succeeds on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int, On Success the target becomes your puppet for as long as you remain concentrating.",B.L,B.aaz,!1)
B.Xd=new A.t("feature_rain_Ice_Storm","Ice Storm","On Success, Give targeted enemies {Source /3} cold. While Concentrating, At the start of your Turn, Make an Status Check vs Wis, On Success, enemies in the area gain {Source /3} cold.")
B.V9=new A.t("feature_rain_Wandering_Storm","Wandering Storm","While Concentrating, At the Start of the Round, you may move your rain area {Source} Spaces.")
B.X2=new A.t("feature_rain_Soothing_Rain","Soothing Rain","when an ally ends their turn in the area they gain {Source d6} shield. This includes the bonus to gaining shields in the area.")
B.a9G=s([B.Xd,B.V9,B.X2],t.U)
B.YI=new A.an("feature_rain","Rain","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Wis, targeting enemies in a 1 space radius range 6. On Success, they take {Source d8} Damage. Regardless, the area remains under a rain cloud as long as you remain concentrating. Whenever an enemy in the area is attacked, they take an extra {half Source d6} damage. Whenever an ally in the area gains shield or heals, increase the amount by {Half Source d6}.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally succeeds on an Attack during their turn, spend your reaction and place a 1 space radius rain cloud so that at least 1 of the spaces of a target of the triggering attack is in the radius that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. Apply the bonus damage to the triggering attack.",B.L,B.a9G,!1)
