B.Yy=new A.an("feature_swallow","Swallow","[Action] Target 1 enemy your size or smaller range 1, and Make a Melee Attack vs Str, On Success: While you remain concentrating, You swallow the target. While swallowed, they are stunned, and they may not be targeted by any ability or effect. On the start of their turn, Make an Status Check vs Str, On Success: Deal {Source d6} Damage. On Failure, They end their turn climbing free and the effect ends. While Concentrating, If the target is your size, you cannot move, and if they are smaller than you, you move at half speed.\n\n[Reaction] At the end of an enemy turn who is range 1, spend your reaction, and make your Swallow action against the triggering enemy.\n",B.L,B.a9o,!1)
