B.Z9=new A.an("feature_tribal_hunter","Tribal Hunter","Coordinated Strike [Action]: You and {Source/3} allies range 6 make either a Ranged Attack vs Dex Range 6 or Melee Attack vs Str range 1 targeting one enemy, on success deal {Source d6} damage for Ranged, and {Source d8} for melee. Each attacker chooses range or melee individually.\n\nJoint Strike [Reaction] Before an Ally you can see makes an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and give the ally a +1 to the attack result. If they succeed, If the attack was Melee, target an enemy range 1, and deal {Source d8} damage vs Str, if the attack was Ranged, target an enemy range 6 and deal {Source d6} damage vs Dex.",B.L,B.abx,!1)
