B.Ki=new A.fz("Water","Combat: Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Level} d6 extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets. Adventuring: After an ally fails a check, give them some water and they gain a +1 to all checks to solve the problem caused by their check.","Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Level} d6 extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets.","After an ally fails a check, give them some water and they gain a +1 to all checks to solve the problem caused by their check.")
