B.Kj=new A.fz("Lightning","Combat: Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone. Adventuring: Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.","Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone.","Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.")
B.Kn=new A.fz("Rainbow","Combat: Before the target makes an attack vs the chosen defense, they may choose to target any defense with a +1 to success. Adventuring: You may spend a usage to let yourself or allies you can see, reroll any skill or defense that was a d4 or d6, or if it is their lowest skill or defense rating.","Before the target makes an attack vs the chosen defense, they may choose to target any defense with a +1 to success.","You may spend a usage to let yourself or allies you can see, reroll any skill or defense that was a d4 or d6, or if it is their lowest skill or defense rating.")
