B.Pk=new A.bO("ranged_poisoner","Poisoner","On Player Failure, They must make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range 1 succeeds on an attack, cause the targets to make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} extra damage.",B.dv,B.cf)
